# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  This repo publishes the SYSTEM, never the LEARNER.
#
#  Everything a newcomer needs is tracked: the tutor rules, the commands, the
#  curriculum, the flashcard app, and blank templates in templates/.
#  Everything about one person's actual learning is ignored: their level, their
#  goals, every mistake they have made, their exam answers, their voice.
#
#  Git cannot ignore a file it already tracks, which is why the state files are
#  shipped as templates/ and copied into place by ./setup.sh.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Who I am and how I'm doing ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# profil.md in particular can contain visa/residence status, employer, and
# language background. It must never be published.
00-State/profil.md
00-State/fortschritt.md
00-State/fehlerlog.md
00-State/dashboard.md

# ── Curriculum: personal once /plan has run ──────────────────────────────────
# plan.md gains your placement score, sub-scores and quotes from your error log;
# module files cite your own mistakes with evidence — that is what makes them
# useful, and also what makes them unpublishable. A neutral copy ships in
# templates/curriculum/ and setup.sh installs it.
01-Curriculum/*
!01-Curriculum/README.md

# ── Generated lessons ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
02-Lektionen/*
!02-Lektionen/README.md

# ── Assignments: the submission and its correction share the file ────────────
03-Aufgaben/*
!03-Aufgaben/README.md

# ── Exams: contain my answers and my grades ──────────────────────────────────
# Blank test + key live in templates/ instead.
04-Prüfungen/*
!04-Prüfungen/README.md

# ── Vocabulary: deck.json carries my mistake history; *.md are generated ─────
05-Vokabeln/*
!05-Vokabeln/README.md

# ── Audio: my own voice, plus large generated .wav files ─────────────────────
06-Audio/*
!06-Audio/README.md
!06-Audio/Aufnahmen/
06-Audio/Aufnahmen/*
!06-Audio/Aufnahmen/README.md

# ── Copyrighted exam material — never commit these ───────────────────────────
# telc/Goethe mock tests and coursebooks are not ours to redistribute.
*.pdf
telc_*
Wortliste_*

# ── Obsidian: per-user workspace, not vault config ───────────────────────────
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
.obsidian/graph.json
.obsidian/hotkeys.json
.obsidian/plugins/
.obsidian/themes/

# ── Claude Code local state ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# settings.json is NOT tracked. Claude Code appends approvals to it as you work,
# including absolute paths containing your username — it drifts constantly and is
# a standing leak risk in a public repo. settings.example.json ships instead, and
# setup.sh installs it.
.claude/settings.json
**/.claude/settings.local.json
**/.claude/history.jsonl
.claude/*.local.json

# ── OS / tooling noise ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
._*
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.tmp
*.bak
scratchpad/
